      "title": "Ahluwalia Contracts (India) Limited Recommends Final Dividend for the Financial Year Ended March 31, 2026",
      "body": "The board of directors of Ahluwalia Contracts (India) Limited at its meeting held on May 30, 2026 have recommended a final dividend at the rate of 35% per equity share (i.e. INR 0.70 Paisa per share) which shall be subject To Approve the Shareholders at the ensuing Annual General Meeting (AGM) of the Company. The Company shall in due course inform the date on which the Company will hold its AGM for the financial year ended March 31, 2026 and the date from which dividend, if approved by the shareholders, will be paid.",
